{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae Demo Content Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo of <i>Lami: A Cup of Code &amp; Coffee</i> features the prologue story and core gameplay, with an estimated playtime of around 15 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Included in the demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic caf\u00e9 management gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small portion of tutorials and story content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One rhythm-based boss challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u274c <strong>Not included in the demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character growth or skill unlocking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full story progression or free exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd27 The game is still in development. If you encounter any issues or have feedback, please feel free to let us know. Thank you for playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/b14ab9e0e4382df9415d543c0b07ed79.avif?t=1753971350\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lami: A Cup of Code &amp; Coffee</strong> is a 3D casual game that blends Japanese aesthetics with caf\u00e9 &amp; workshop management, and rhythm gameplay. The story follows a young protagonist who, feeling disenchanted with their mundane life, receives a letter from their late grandfather asking them to take over his caf\u00e9. Intrigued, the protagonist quits their job and heads to the caf\u00e9, only to discover a hidden research lab on the upper floor, where an AI robot girl named Lami awakens. It turns out that Lami was developed by the protagonist\u2019s grandfather, and now, together with Lami, they embark on a new life managing the caf\u00e9. What challenges await them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/e95ec2dfd6c5a253c6bf618b838f8ec2.avif?t=1753971350\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2615Run a coffee shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a cafe with Lami, move around the cafe, use different furniture and equipment, and quickly complete customers' orders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/233c22a31564f3f1b9f789b6700c0241.poster.avif?t=1753971350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/233c22a31564f3f1b9f789b6700c0241.webm?t=1753971350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/233c22a31564f3f1b9f789b6700c0241.mp4?t=1753971350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfe1Customized decoration to create a unique space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create your dream cafe! Place the furniture and decorate, it's all up to you. Different furnishings will also affect the effect of the cafe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/6e46e1c7d1fc89613d6f8288a5dbf188.poster.avif?t=1753971350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/6e46e1c7d1fc89613d6f8288a5dbf188.webm?t=1753971350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/6e46e1c7d1fc89613d6f8288a5dbf188.mp4?t=1753971350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2328\ufe0f Code to the Beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a unique rhythm game where you &quot;write code&quot; in sync with the beat, upgrading Lami's abilities in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/1e57e682e8f2eb60d33b2a0862c25967.poster.avif?t=1753971350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/1e57e682e8f2eb60d33b2a0862c25967.webm?t=1753971350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/1e57e682e8f2eb60d33b2a0862c25967.mp4?t=1753971350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd29 Invent, Craft &amp; Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather materials, build new furniture, upgrade Lami, and unlock new tools to enhance the caf\u00e9 experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/bd67968101464c7fb616cb2adf288711.poster.avif?t=1753971350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/bd67968101464c7fb616cb2adf288711.webm?t=1753971350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/bd67968101464c7fb616cb2adf288711.mp4?t=1753971350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/b2913794c0eafdcf072b3e34d08943a5.poster.avif?t=1753971350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/b2913794c0eafdcf072b3e34d08943a5.webm?t=1753971350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/extras/b2913794c0eafdcf072b3e34d08943a5.mp4?t=1753971350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready to Take on the Challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Lami by your side, uncover your grandfather\u2019s hidden secrets and bring the caf\u00e9 back to life!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900520?t=1753971350","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900520?t=1753971350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/21dbbfe499f3767efb15908daa0ee7b6418cab09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753971350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900520/21dbbfe499f3767efb15908daa0ee7b6418cab09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753971350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae Demo Content Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo of <i>Lami: A Cup of Code &amp; Coffee</i> features the prologue story and core gameplay, with an estimated playtime of around 15 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Included in the demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic caf\u00e9 management gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small portion of tutorials and story content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One rhythm-based boss challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u274c <strong>Not included in the demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character growth or